From aba53830e5b2efa40c8cc80b5635204834280111 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:00:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CUSTOM: split facial features - geoset slots in
 character_customizations 5, 10-15 (F-230)

- ZEPO block (uint32 'ZEPO', n, bytes) read after the last field of CMSG_CHAR_CREATE, CMSG_CHAR_CUSTOMIZE,
  CMSG_CHAR_FACTION_CHANGE / RACE_CHANGE; CMSG_ALTER_APPEARANCE accepts and ignores it (barber phase 2). Absent = unchanged.
- create saves jewellery (5) and slots 0-5 (10-15), non-zero only; customize / race / faction change replace them
  from the block, or clear them when race or gender changed without one (CHAR_DEL_CHARACTER_ZEP_GEOSETS)
- SMSG_CHAR_ENUM ZEPD trailer carries n = 11 (ids 1-5, 10-15); CHAR_SEL_ENUM(_DECLINED_NAME) joins the 7 new ids
- login packs slots into OBJECT_FIELD_PADDING (slot s bits 4s..4s+3, jewellery bits 24-31); field now PUBLIC

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01URnr7tKsFMZq4VFsSKkj3S
